{
  "id": 4220,
  "title": "数据类型与精度 (FP16, INT8)",
  "meta_title": "LLM数据类型与精度 (FP16, INT8)",
  "meta_description": "介绍数据精度（如FP16、INT8）如何影响模型在内存中的大小。",
  "content": "<p>组成一个LLM的数百万或数十亿参数 (parameter)需要加载到计算机内存中才能运行。具体来说，为了在推理 (inference)过程中进行快速处理，这些参数最好存在于GPU的专用内存，即VRAM中。但每个参数<em>实际</em>占用多少内存呢？答案取决于其<strong>数据类型</strong>和<strong>精度</strong>。</p>\n<p>可以将数据类型想象成计算机内部存储数字的容器。就像你的厨房里有不同大小的容器来存放不同量的食物一样，计算机使用不同大小的数字容器来存储数字。容器的大小决定了数字的<strong>精度</strong>，本质上是它能表示多少细节。</p>\n<h3>标准精度：浮点32 (FP32)</h3>\n<p>传统上，许多机器学习 (machine learning)模型，包括早期的LLM，都使用一种名为<strong>浮点32</strong>的数据类型进行训练，通常缩写为<strong>FP32</strong>。以FP32格式存储的每个参数 (parameter)占用32位内存。</p>\n<p>由于一个字节有8位，一个FP32参数占用：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>32</mn><mtext> 位</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>8</mn><mtext> 位/字节</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mtext> 字节</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">32 \\text{ 位} / 8 \\text{ 位/字节} = 4 \\text{ 字节}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">位</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/8</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">位</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节</span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>这听起来可能不多，但请记住，LLM有<em>数十亿</em>参数。让我们考虑一个相对较小的70亿参数模型（通常写作7B）。要使用FP32存储其参数，内存需求是：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mtext> 参数</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mtext> 字节/参数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>28</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mtext> 字节</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7,000,000,000 \\text{ 参数} \\times 4 \\text{ 字节/参数} = 28,000,000,000 \\text{ 字节}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">参数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">参数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">28</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节</span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>那是280亿字节，相当于28千兆字节（GB）的内存，主要是VRAM，仅仅用于模型权重 (weight)！这是一个很大的量，强调了为什么运行更大的模型需要大量硬件。</p>\n<h3>减少内存使用：浮点16 (FP16)</h3>\n<p>为了让LLM更易于使用和高效，开发者经常使用较低精度的数据类型。其中非常常见的一种是<strong>浮点16 (FP16)</strong>，有时被称为“半精度”。顾名思义，每个FP16参数 (parameter)仅使用16位。</p>\n<p>计算每个参数的内存：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn><mtext> 位</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>8</mn><mtext> 位/字节</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext> 字节</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16 \\text{ 位} / 8 \\text{ 位/字节} = 2 \\text{ 字节}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">位</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/8</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">位</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节</span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>现在，我们使用FP16重新计算70亿参数模型所需的内存：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mtext> 参数</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext> 字节/参数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mtext> 字节</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7,000,000,000 \\text{ 参数} \\times 2 \\text{ 字节/参数} = 14,000,000,000 \\text{ 字节}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">参数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">参数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节</span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>这是14 GB。通过从FP32切换到FP16，我们将模型参数所需的内存<em>减少了一半</em>！这产生了巨大的影响。这意味着您可能能够在具有16 GB VRAM的GPU上运行该模型，而FP32版本将需要具有超过28 GB VRAM的GPU。</p>\n<p>使用一半的精度会损害模型性能吗？有时精度会略有下降，但对于许多任务，特别是推理 (inference)（运行模型），差异通常可以忽略不计，使得FP16成为部署LLM的流行选择。</p>\n<h3>进一步减少：整数8 (INT8)</h3>\n<p>我们可以使用整数数据类型，如<strong>整数8 (INT8)</strong>，来进一步减少内存使用。一个INT8参数 (parameter)仅使用8位。</p>\n<p>每个参数的内存：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mtext> 位</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>8</mn><mtext> 位/字节</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> 字节</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8 \\text{ 位} / 8 \\text{ 位/字节} = 1 \\text{ 字节}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">位</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/8</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">位</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节</span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>对于我们的70亿参数示例模型，内存需求变为：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mtext> 参数</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> 字节/参数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mtext> 字节</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7,000,000,000 \\text{ 参数} \\times 1 \\text{ 字节/参数} = 7,000,000,000 \\text{ 字节}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">参数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">参数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节</span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>那仅是7 GB！这是FP16内存的一半，是原始FP32需求的四分之一。使用INT8使得更大的模型可以在更一般的硬件上运行。</p>\n<p>然而，仅用8位表示参数会显著降低其范围和精度，与浮点类型相比。如果处理不当，这可能导致模型精度出现更明显的下降。通常需要量化 (quantization)感知训练或复杂的转换方法来最小化这种精度损失。</p>\n<h3>影响的可视化</h3>\n<p>数据类型的选择直接影响所需的VRAM。让我们将使用这些不同精度存储70亿参数 (parameter)模型的估算内存需求可视化：</p>\n\n            <div\n              class=\"plotly-container\" \n              data-plot-id=\"plot-1gvsffv\" \n              data-plot-definition='{\"data\": [{\"x\": [\"FP32 (32位)\", \"FP16 (16位)\", \"INT8 (8位)\"], \"y\": [28, 14, 7], \"type\": \"bar\", \"marker\": {\"color\": [\"#4263eb\", \"#74c0fc\", \"#a5d8ff\"]}}], \"layout\": {\"title\": \"70亿参数模型VRAM估算：不同精度对比\", \"xaxis\": {\"title\": \"数据类型 / 精度\"}, \"yaxis\": {\"title\": \"估算所需VRAM (GB)\"}, \"margin\": {\"l\": 50, \"r\": 20, \"t\": 50, \"b\": 40}}}' \n              style=\"max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; min-height: 300px;\"\n            >\n              <div id=\"plot-1gvsffv\" style=\"width: 100%; min-height: 300px;\"></div>\n            </div>\n          \n<blockquote>\n<p>仅用于存储70亿参数LLM的模型参数所需VRAM估算，根据使用的数据类型精度。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>如图所示，从FP32转向FP16使内存占用减少一半，而转向INT8则再次减少一半。这种减少是使得LLM能在消费级GPU上运行或在资源受限环境中优化其性能的重要因素。</p>\n<p>在实际应用中，FP16已成为LLM推理 (inference)的非常常见标准，因为它在内存节省、现代GPU上的速度提升以及对输出质量影响最小方面达到了很好的平衡。INT8也越来越多地被使用，特别是在内存或速度要求严格时，通常涉及我们接下来将介绍的一个过程：量化 (quantization)。理解这些数据类型是估算您所需硬件的第一步。</p>",
